Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 15:33:41 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/1] bump samsung light aidl import to android.hardware.light-V3

grapheneos frameworks links android.hardware.light-V3 from services.core;
the samsung light hal import must match or soong rejects the mixed
versions in the same module
---
 aidl/vendor/samsung/hardware/light/Android.bp | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/aidl/vendor/samsung/hardware/light/Android.bp b/aidl/vendor/samsung/hardware/light/Android.bp
index 785ac69..9329ea7 100644
--- a/aidl/vendor/samsung/hardware/light/Android.bp
+++ b/aidl/vendor/samsung/hardware/light/Android.bp
@@ -17,11 +17,11 @@ aidl_interface {
         },
     },
     owner: "phh",
-    imports: ["android.hardware.light-V1"],
+    imports: ["android.hardware.light-V3"],
     versions_with_info: [
         {
             version: "1",
-            imports: ["android.hardware.light-V1"],
+            imports: ["android.hardware.light-V3"],
         },
 
     ],
